{"4624310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seventh Mansion: The First Escape", "steam_appid": 4624310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left inside an Eerie mansion, you must find a way to escape before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seventh Mansion: The First Escape</i> is a first-person psychological horror escape room where every death changes the experience. Explore an eerie, atmospheric mansion filled with secrets, solve puzzles, and survive encounters with the lurking Wicked Nuns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could fight your way with a camera, or you could break the static radio. This will be your choice or else Death is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But death is not the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fall, the mansion changes—puzzles evolve, and new dangers emerge. No two attempts are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Camera-based survival mechanic inspired by tension and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ A haunting mansion with multiple variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Puzzle-driven escape room gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Permadeath system that resets your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Procedural elements that change each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌫️ Immersive atmospheric horror experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape… or will the mansion keep you forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: This game relies heavily on proximity-based audio cues. For the intended experience, headphones are required.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left inside an Eerie mansion, you must find a way to escape before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seventh Mansion: The First Escape</i> is a first-person psychological horror escape room where every death changes the experience. Explore an eerie, atmospheric mansion filled with secrets, solve puzzles, and survive encounters with the lurking Wicked Nuns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could fight your way with a camera, or you could break the static radio. This will be your choice or else Death is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But death is not the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fall, the mansion changes—puzzles evolve, and new dangers emerge. No two attempts are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Camera-based survival mechanic inspired by tension and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ A haunting mansion with multiple variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Puzzle-driven escape room gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Permadeath system that resets your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Procedural elements that change each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌫️ Immersive atmospheric horror experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape… or will the mansion keep you forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: This game relies heavily on proximity-based audio cues. For the intended experience, headphones are required.</p>", "short_description": "Escape an eerie mansion where death resets everything. Solve puzzles, evade the Wicked Nuns, or use a camera to survive in this psychological horror experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4624310/e7a30ede6fca1bf2f21cdab4c219e357782698f7/header.jpg?t=1785383985", "capsule_image": "h